---
import { CornerDownRight } from "lucide-astro";

const isId = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith('/id');
---

<section class="process-section">

  <div class="process-grid">
    <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->
    <div class="left-col">
      <div class="badge">
        <div class="badge-dot"></div>
        <span class="badge-text">{isId ? 'PROSES SAYA' : 'MY PROCESS'}</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="heading">
        {isId ? 'Alur Kerja' : 'My Creative'}<br />
        {isId ? 'Kreatif' : 'Workflow'}
      </h2>

      <a href={isId ? '/id/contact' : '/contact'} class="cta-button group">
        <CornerDownRight class="icon-cta" />
        <span>{isId ? 'Hubungi Saya' : 'Get in Touch'}</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->
    <div class="right-col">
      <div class="process-item">
        <h3 class="item-title">{isId ? '1. Penemuan' : '1. Discovery'}</h3>
        <p class="item-text">
          {isId 
            ? 'Saya mendalami pemahaman tentang kebutuhan bisnis, tujuan teknis, dan target pengguna Anda. Melalui konsultasi dan riset terperinci, saya mengumpulkan wawasan penting yang menginformasikan seluruh proses pengembangan.' 
            : 'I dive deep into understanding your business needs, technical goals, and target users. Through detailed consultations and research, I gather essential insights that inform the entire development process.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-item">
        <h3 class="item-title">{isId ? '2. Arsitektur' : '2. Architecture'}</h3>
        <p class="item-text">
          {isId 
            ? 'Saya merancang arsitektur sistem yang scalable dan maintainable. Langkah ini berfokus pada pemilihan teknologi yang tepat dan pola desain yang selaras dengan kebutuhan proyek Anda.' 
            : 'I design scalable and maintainable system architecture. This step focuses on selecting the right technology stack and design patterns that align with your project needs.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-item">
        <h3 class="item-title">{isId ? '3. Pengembangan' : '3. Development'}</h3>
        <p class="item-text">
          {isId 
            ? 'Saya mengubah arsitektur menjadi aplikasi yang berfungsi penuh. Fase ini melibatkan pengkodean yang cermat dan integrasi untuk memastikan sistem Anda responsif dan berjalan lancar di berbagai environment.' 
            : 'I transform the architecture into a fully functional application. This phase involves meticulous coding and integration to ensure your system is responsive and performs seamlessly across environments.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="process-item">
        <h3 class="item-title">{isId ? '4. Peluncuran' : '4. Launch'}</h3>
        <p class="item-text">
          {isId 
            ? 'Saya menguji situs web secara ketat untuk memastikan semuanya berfungsi tanpa celah sebelum tayang. Pasca-peluncuran, saya memberikan dukungan dan panduan untuk membantu Anda memaksimalkan kehadiran online baru Anda.' 
            : 'I rigorously test the website to ensure everything functions flawlessly before going live. Post-launch, I provide support and guidance to help you maximize your new online presence.'}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .process-section {
    position: relative;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    color: #0A0A0A;
    height: auto;
    padding-inline: clamp(24px, 2.5vw, 40px);
    padding-block: 80px;
    font-family: Inter, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .process-grid {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(40px, 7vw, 90px);
    align-items: start;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  /* LEFT COLUMN */
  .left-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #9A9A9A;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 6px 16px;
  }

  .badge-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .badge-text {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #0A0A0A;
  }

  .heading {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.2vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #0A0A0A;
    margin-top: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .cta-button {
    margin-top: 48px;
    background-color: var(--accent);
    color: #0A0A0A;
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: filter 0.3s ease;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.1);
  }

  .icon-cta {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    color: #0A0A0A;
  }

  /* RIGHT COLUMN */
  .right-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .process-item {
    padding-block: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  /* The first item doesn't need top padding since the border is bottom */
  .process-item:first-child {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .item-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #0A0A0A;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .item-text {
    margin-top: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #0A0A0A;
  }

  /* RESPONSIVE */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .process-section {
      padding-block: 80px;
    }
    
    .process-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .heading {
      font-size: 28px;
    }
    
    .cta-button {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
